>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CBCHAIN.

*> 台帳部品。画面出力はしない。結果は要求ブロックの状態で返す。
*>
*> ファイル形式（版 01）:
*>   先頭行 CBCH|01|DD|    DD は難易度 01 から 08
*>   続く各行は 297 バイト
*>     1-8 番号  10-23 時刻  25-88 前ハッシュ
*>     90-92 データ長  94-221 データ  223-232 ナンス  234-297 ハッシュ
*> ハッシュ入力は番号、時刻、前ハッシュ、データ長、データの実バイト、ナンス。
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT LEDGER ASSIGN TO LEDGER-NAME
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS LEDGER-FS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD LEDGER.
01 LEDGER-REC PIC X(297).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY cbconst.
01 LEDGER-NAME PIC X(256).
01 LEDGER-FS PIC XX.
01 OPEN-FLAG PIC X VALUE "N".
    88 FILE-OPEN VALUE "Y".
01 MORE-FLAG PIC X VALUE "N".
    88 MORE-RECORDS VALUE "Y".
01 FOUND-FLAG PIC X VALUE "N".
    88 BLOCK-FOUND VALUE "Y".
01 POW-FLAG PIC X VALUE "N".
    88 POW-MET VALUE "Y".

01 REQ-FUNC PIC 99.
01 REQ-OPT PIC 99.
01 REQ-PLEN PIC 9(4).
01 REQ-DLEN PIC 9(4).
01 REQ-DIFF PIC 99.
01 REQ-MAX PIC 9(10).
01 REQ-INDEX PIC 9(8).
01 REQ-TS PIC X(14).
01 REQ-PATH PIC X(256).
01 REQ-DATA PIC X(128).

01 HDR-DIFF PIC 99.
01 HDR-DIFF-X REDEFINES HDR-DIFF PIC XX.
01 LINK-PREV PIC X(64).
01 LAST-LINK PIC X(64).
01 CUR-INDEX PIC 9(8).
01 CUR-INDEX-X REDEFINES CUR-INDEX PIC X(8).
01 CUR-TS PIC X(14).
01 CUR-PREV PIC X(64).
01 CUR-DLEN PIC 9(4).
01 CUR-DATA PIC X(128).
01 CUR-NONCE PIC 9(10).
01 CUR-NONCE-X REDEFINES CUR-NONCE PIC X(10).
01 CUR-HASH PIC X(64).
01 FILE-DLEN PIC 9(3).
01 FILE-DLEN-X REDEFINES FILE-DLEN PIC XXX.
01 HOLD-PREV PIC X(64).
01 EXPECTED-PREV PIC X(64).
01 EXPECTED-INDEX PIC 9(8).
01 SEEN-COUNT PIC 9(8).
01 NOW PIC X(21).
01 CANON PIC X(227).
01 CANON-LEN PIC 9(4).
01 CANON-AT PIC 9(4).
01 REST-N PIC 9(4).
01 REST-AT PIC 9(4).
01 SCAN-I PIC 9(4).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY cbrequest.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CB-REQUEST.
ENTRY-POINT.
    PERFORM DISPATCH
    MOVE CB-STATUS TO RETURN-CODE
    GOBACK
    .

DISPATCH.
    IF FILE-OPEN
        PERFORM CLOSE-LEDGER
    END-IF
    PERFORM SNAP-INPUT
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM CLEAR-OUTPUT
    EVALUATE REQ-FUNC
        WHEN CB-FN-INIT
            PERFORM DO-INIT
        WHEN CB-FN-APPEND
            PERFORM DO-APPEND
        WHEN CB-FN-GET
            PERFORM DO-GET
        WHEN CB-FN-VERIFY
            PERFORM DO-VERIFY
        WHEN CB-FN-COUNT
            PERFORM DO-COUNT
        WHEN CB-FN-LAST
            PERFORM DO-LAST
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE CB-ERR-FUNC TO CB-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE
    .

SNAP-INPUT.
    MOVE CB-OK TO CB-STATUS
    MOVE "00" TO CB-FS
    MOVE 0 TO CB-DETAIL
    IF CB-FUNC IS NOT NUMERIC
        MOVE CB-ERR-FUNC TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE CB-FUNC TO REQ-FUNC
    IF REQ-FUNC < CB-FN-INIT OR REQ-FUNC > CB-FN-LAST
        MOVE CB-ERR-FUNC TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF CB-OPTIONS IS NOT NUMERIC
        MOVE CB-WHY-OPTIONS TO CB-DETAIL
        MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE CB-OPTIONS TO REQ-OPT
    IF REQ-OPT NOT = CB-OPT-NONE AND REQ-OPT NOT = CB-OPT-REPLACE
        MOVE CB-WHY-OPTIONS TO CB-DETAIL
        MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF CB-PATH-LEN IS NOT NUMERIC
        MOVE CB-WHY-PATH TO CB-DETAIL
        MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE CB-PATH-LEN TO REQ-PLEN
    IF REQ-PLEN < 1 OR REQ-PLEN > 256
        MOVE CB-WHY-PATH TO CB-DETAIL
        MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM VARYING SCAN-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SCAN-I > REQ-PLEN
        IF CB-PATH(SCAN-I:1) = LOW-VALUE
            MOVE CB-WHY-PATH TO CB-DETAIL
            MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE SPACES TO REQ-PATH
    MOVE CB-PATH(1:REQ-PLEN) TO REQ-PATH
    MOVE CB-DATA TO REQ-DATA
    MOVE CB-TIMESTAMP TO REQ-TS
    IF CB-DATA-LEN IS NUMERIC
        MOVE CB-DATA-LEN TO REQ-DLEN
    ELSE
        IF REQ-FUNC = CB-FN-INIT OR REQ-FUNC = CB-FN-APPEND
            MOVE CB-WHY-DATA TO CB-DETAIL
            MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
        MOVE 0 TO REQ-DLEN
    END-IF
    IF CB-DIFFICULTY IS NUMERIC
        MOVE CB-DIFFICULTY TO REQ-DIFF
    ELSE
        IF REQ-FUNC = CB-FN-INIT OR REQ-FUNC = CB-FN-APPEND
            MOVE CB-WHY-DIFFICULTY TO CB-DETAIL
            MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
        MOVE 0 TO REQ-DIFF
    END-IF
    IF CB-MAX-NONCE IS NUMERIC
        MOVE CB-MAX-NONCE TO REQ-MAX
    ELSE
        IF REQ-FUNC = CB-FN-INIT OR REQ-FUNC = CB-FN-APPEND
            MOVE CB-WHY-NONCE TO CB-DETAIL
            MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
        MOVE 0 TO REQ-MAX
    END-IF
    IF CB-INDEX IS NUMERIC
        MOVE CB-INDEX TO REQ-INDEX
    ELSE
        IF REQ-FUNC = CB-FN-GET
            MOVE CB-WHY-INDEX TO CB-DETAIL
            MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
        MOVE 0 TO REQ-INDEX
    END-IF
    .

CLEAR-OUTPUT.
    MOVE 0 TO CB-STATUS
    MOVE "00" TO CB-FS
    MOVE 0 TO CB-DETAIL
    MOVE 0 TO CB-COUNT
    MOVE 0 TO CB-INDEX
    MOVE 0 TO CB-BLEN
    MOVE 0 TO CB-NONCE
    MOVE 0 TO CB-DIFFICULTY
    MOVE SPACES TO CB-TIME
    MOVE SPACES TO CB-PREV
    MOVE SPACES TO CB-BDATA
    MOVE SPACES TO CB-HASH
    .

DO-INIT.
    PERFORM REQUIRE-PAYLOAD
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM RESOLVE-DIFF-INIT
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM RESOLVE-TIME
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM RESOLVE-MAX
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM OPEN-IN
    IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
        PERFORM CLOSE-LEDGER
        IF REQ-OPT NOT = CB-OPT-REPLACE
            MOVE CB-ERR-EXISTS TO CB-STATUS
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
    ELSE
        IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-ERR-NOT-FOUND
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
        MOVE CB-OK TO CB-STATUS
        MOVE "00" TO CB-FS
    END-IF
    PERFORM BUILD-GENESIS
    PERFORM MINE-CUR
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM OPEN-OUT
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM WRITE-HEADER
    IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
        PERFORM WRITE-BLOCK
    END-IF
    PERFORM CLOSE-LEDGER
    IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
        PERFORM EXPORT-CUR
        MOVE 1 TO CB-COUNT
    END-IF
    .

DO-APPEND.
    PERFORM REQUIRE-PAYLOAD
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF REQ-DIFF > 8
        MOVE CB-WHY-DIFFICULTY TO CB-DETAIL
        MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM RESOLVE-TIME
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM RESOLVE-MAX
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM FULL-SCAN
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF SEEN-COUNT = 0
        MOVE CB-ERR-EMPTY TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF REQ-DIFF NOT = 0 AND REQ-DIFF NOT = HDR-DIFF
        MOVE CB-ERR-DIFFICULTY TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM BUILD-NEXT
    PERFORM MINE-CUR
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM OPEN-EXTEND
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM WRITE-BLOCK
    PERFORM CLOSE-LEDGER
    IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
        PERFORM EXPORT-CUR
        ADD 1 TO SEEN-COUNT
        MOVE SEEN-COUNT TO CB-COUNT
    END-IF
    .

DO-GET.
    PERFORM OPEN-AND-HEADER
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        PERFORM CLOSE-LEDGER
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO SEEN-COUNT
    MOVE ALL "0" TO HOLD-PREV
    MOVE "N" TO FOUND-FLAG
    PERFORM READ-ONE
    PERFORM UNTIL NOT MORE-RECORDS
        OR BLOCK-FOUND OR CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        PERFORM UNPACK-BLOCK
        IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
            IF CUR-INDEX = REQ-INDEX
                PERFORM CHECK-ONE-BLOCK
                MOVE "Y" TO FOUND-FLAG
            ELSE
                MOVE CUR-HASH TO HOLD-PREV
                ADD 1 TO SEEN-COUNT
            END-IF
        END-IF
        IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK AND NOT BLOCK-FOUND
            PERFORM READ-ONE
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM CLOSE-LEDGER
    IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK AND NOT BLOCK-FOUND
        MOVE SEEN-COUNT TO CB-DETAIL
        MOVE CB-ERR-RANGE TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
        PERFORM EXPORT-CUR
    END-IF
    .

DO-VERIFY.
    PERFORM FULL-SCAN
    IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK AND SEEN-COUNT = 0
        MOVE CB-ERR-EMPTY TO CB-STATUS
    END-IF
    IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
        PERFORM EXPORT-CUR
    END-IF
    .

DO-COUNT.
    PERFORM OPEN-AND-HEADER
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        PERFORM CLOSE-LEDGER
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO SEEN-COUNT
    PERFORM READ-ONE
    PERFORM UNTIL NOT MORE-RECORDS OR CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        PERFORM UNPACK-BLOCK
        IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
            ADD 1 TO SEEN-COUNT
            PERFORM READ-ONE
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM CLOSE-LEDGER
    IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
        MOVE SEEN-COUNT TO CB-COUNT
        MOVE HDR-DIFF TO CB-DIFFICULTY
    END-IF
    .

DO-LAST.
    PERFORM OPEN-AND-HEADER
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        PERFORM CLOSE-LEDGER
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO SEEN-COUNT
    MOVE ALL "0" TO LINK-PREV
    MOVE ALL "0" TO LAST-LINK
    MOVE "N" TO FOUND-FLAG
    PERFORM READ-ONE
    PERFORM UNTIL NOT MORE-RECORDS OR CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        PERFORM UNPACK-BLOCK
        IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
            MOVE LINK-PREV TO LAST-LINK
            MOVE CUR-HASH TO LINK-PREV
            ADD 1 TO SEEN-COUNT
            MOVE "Y" TO FOUND-FLAG
            PERFORM READ-ONE
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM CLOSE-LEDGER
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF NOT BLOCK-FOUND
        MOVE CB-ERR-EMPTY TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE LAST-LINK TO HOLD-PREV
    PERFORM CHECK-ONE-BLOCK
    IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
        PERFORM EXPORT-CUR
        MOVE SEEN-COUNT TO CB-COUNT
    END-IF
    .

FULL-SCAN.
    PERFORM OPEN-AND-HEADER
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        PERFORM CLOSE-LEDGER
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO SEEN-COUNT
    MOVE 0 TO EXPECTED-INDEX
    MOVE ALL "0" TO EXPECTED-PREV
    PERFORM READ-ONE
    PERFORM UNTIL NOT MORE-RECORDS OR CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK-FULL
        IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
            ADD 1 TO SEEN-COUNT
            MOVE CUR-HASH TO EXPECTED-PREV
            ADD 1 TO EXPECTED-INDEX
            PERFORM READ-ONE
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM CLOSE-LEDGER
    MOVE SEEN-COUNT TO CB-COUNT
    IF CB-STATUS = CB-OK
        MOVE 0 TO CB-DETAIL
        IF SEEN-COUNT > 0
            MOVE HDR-DIFF TO CB-DIFFICULTY
        END-IF
    END-IF
    .

OPEN-AND-HEADER.
    PERFORM OPEN-IN
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM READ-ONE
    IF NOT MORE-RECORDS
        MOVE CB-ERR-FORMAT TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM ACCEPT-HEADER
    .

ACCEPT-HEADER.
    IF LEDGER-REC(1:8) NOT = "CBCH|01|"
        OR LEDGER-REC(11:1) NOT = "|"
        OR LEDGER-REC(9:2) IS NOT NUMERIC
        OR LEDGER-REC(12:286) NOT = SPACES
        MOVE CB-ERR-FORMAT TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE LEDGER-REC(9:2) TO HDR-DIFF
    IF HDR-DIFF < 1 OR HDR-DIFF > 8
        MOVE CB-ERR-FORMAT TO CB-STATUS
    END-IF
    .

CHECK-BLOCK-FULL.
    MOVE EXPECTED-INDEX TO CB-DETAIL
    PERFORM UNPACK-BLOCK
    IF CB-STATUS NOT = CB-OK
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF CUR-INDEX NOT = EXPECTED-INDEX
        MOVE CB-ERR-INDEX TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE EXPECTED-PREV TO HOLD-PREV
    PERFORM CHECK-ONE-BLOCK
    .

CHECK-ONE-BLOCK.
    IF CUR-PREV NOT = HOLD-PREV
        MOVE CUR-INDEX TO CB-DETAIL
        MOVE CB-ERR-LINK TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE CUR-HASH TO HOLD-PREV
    PERFORM HASH-CUR
    IF CUR-HASH NOT = HOLD-PREV
        MOVE CUR-INDEX TO CB-DETAIL
        MOVE CB-ERR-HASH TO CB-STATUS
        MOVE HOLD-PREV TO CUR-HASH
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    PERFORM MARK-POW
    IF NOT POW-MET
        MOVE CUR-INDEX TO CB-DETAIL
        MOVE CB-ERR-DIFFICULTY TO CB-STATUS
    END-IF
    .

UNPACK-BLOCK.
    IF LEDGER-REC(9:1) NOT = "|"
        OR LEDGER-REC(24:1) NOT = "|"
        OR LEDGER-REC(89:1) NOT = "|"
        OR LEDGER-REC(93:1) NOT = "|"
        OR LEDGER-REC(222:1) NOT = "|"
        OR LEDGER-REC(233:1) NOT = "|"
        MOVE CB-ERR-FORMAT TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF LEDGER-REC(1:8) IS NOT NUMERIC
        OR LEDGER-REC(10:14) IS NOT NUMERIC
        OR LEDGER-REC(90:3) IS NOT NUMERIC
        OR LEDGER-REC(223:10) IS NOT NUMERIC
        MOVE CB-ERR-FORMAT TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE LEDGER-REC(90:3) TO FILE-DLEN
    IF FILE-DLEN < 1 OR FILE-DLEN > CB-DATA-MAX
        MOVE CB-ERR-FORMAT TO CB-STATUS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF FILE-DLEN < CB-DATA-MAX
        COMPUTE REST-N = CB-DATA-MAX - FILE-DLEN
        COMPUTE REST-AT = 94 + FILE-DLEN
        IF LEDGER-REC(REST-AT:REST-N) NOT = SPACES
            MOVE CB-ERR-FORMAT TO CB-STATUS
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF
    END-IF
    MOVE LEDGER-REC(1:8) TO CUR-INDEX
    MOVE LEDGER-REC(10:14) TO CUR-TS
    MOVE LEDGER-REC(25:64) TO CUR-PREV
    MOVE FILE-DLEN TO CUR-DLEN
    MOVE SPACES TO CUR-DATA
    MOVE LEDGER-REC(94:CUR-DLEN) TO CUR-DATA(1:CUR-DLEN)
    MOVE LEDGER-REC(223:10) TO CUR-NONCE
    MOVE LEDGER-REC(234:64) TO CUR-HASH
    .

REQUIRE-PAYLOAD.
    IF REQ-DLEN < 1 OR REQ-DLEN > CB-DATA-MAX
        MOVE CB-WHY-DATA TO CB-DETAIL
        MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
    END-IF
    .

RESOLVE-DIFF-INIT.
    IF REQ-DIFF = 0
        MOVE CB-DEFAULT-DIFF TO HDR-DIFF
    ELSE
        IF REQ-DIFF < 1 OR REQ-DIFF > 8
            MOVE CB-WHY-DIFFICULTY TO CB-DETAIL
            MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
        ELSE
            MOVE REQ-DIFF TO HDR-DIFF
        END-IF
    END-IF
    .

RESOLVE-TIME.
    IF REQ-TS = SPACES OR REQ-TS = LOW-VALUES OR REQ-TS = ALL "0"
        MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO NOW
        MOVE NOW(1:14) TO REQ-TS
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF REQ-TS IS NOT NUMERIC
        MOVE CB-WHY-TIMESTAMP TO CB-DETAIL
        MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
    END-IF
    .

RESOLVE-MAX.
    IF REQ-MAX = 0
        MOVE CB-DEFAULT-MAX-NONCE TO REQ-MAX
    END-IF
    IF REQ-MAX > CB-NONCE-LIMIT
        MOVE CB-WHY-NONCE TO CB-DETAIL
        MOVE CB-ERR-ARGUMENT TO CB-STATUS
    END-IF
    .

BUILD-GENESIS.
    MOVE 0 TO CUR-INDEX
    MOVE REQ-TS TO CUR-TS
    MOVE ALL "0" TO CUR-PREV
    MOVE SPACES TO CUR-DATA
    MOVE REQ-DATA(1:REQ-DLEN) TO CUR-DATA(1:REQ-DLEN)
    MOVE REQ-DLEN TO CUR-DLEN
    MOVE 0 TO CUR-NONCE
    MOVE SPACES TO CUR-HASH
    .

BUILD-NEXT.
    MOVE CUR-HASH TO HOLD-PREV
    ADD 1 TO CUR-INDEX
    MOVE HOLD-PREV TO CUR-PREV
    MOVE SPACES TO CUR-DATA
    MOVE REQ-DATA(1:REQ-DLEN) TO CUR-DATA(1:REQ-DLEN)
    MOVE REQ-DLEN TO CUR-DLEN
    MOVE REQ-TS TO CUR-TS
    MOVE 0 TO CUR-NONCE
    MOVE SPACES TO CUR-HASH
    .

MINE-CUR.
    MOVE "N" TO POW-FLAG
    MOVE 0 TO CUR-NONCE
    PERFORM UNTIL CUR-NONCE > REQ-MAX OR POW-MET
        PERFORM HASH-CUR
        PERFORM MARK-POW
        IF NOT POW-MET
            ADD 1 TO CUR-NONCE
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    IF NOT POW-MET
        MOVE CB-ERR-POW TO CB-STATUS
    END-IF
    .

MARK-POW.
    MOVE "Y" TO POW-FLAG
    PERFORM VARYING SCAN-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SCAN-I > HDR-DIFF
        IF CUR-HASH(SCAN-I:1) NOT = "0"
            MOVE "N" TO POW-FLAG
            EXIT PERFORM
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    .

HASH-CUR.
    MOVE CUR-INDEX-X TO CANON(1:8)
    MOVE CUR-TS TO CANON(9:14)
    MOVE CUR-PREV TO CANON(23:64)
    MOVE CUR-DLEN TO FILE-DLEN
    MOVE FILE-DLEN-X TO CANON(87:3)
    IF CUR-DLEN > 0
        MOVE CUR-DATA(1:CUR-DLEN) TO CANON(90:CUR-DLEN)
    END-IF
    COMPUTE CANON-AT = 90 + CUR-DLEN
    MOVE CUR-NONCE-X TO CANON(CANON-AT:10)
    COMPUTE CANON-LEN = 99 + CUR-DLEN
    CALL "SHA256" USING CANON CANON-LEN CUR-HASH
    .

EXPORT-CUR.
    MOVE CUR-INDEX TO CB-INDEX
    MOVE CUR-TS TO CB-TIME
    MOVE CUR-TS TO CB-TIMESTAMP
    MOVE CUR-PREV TO CB-PREV
    MOVE CUR-DLEN TO CB-BLEN
    MOVE SPACES TO CB-BDATA
    IF CUR-DLEN > 0
        MOVE CUR-DATA(1:CUR-DLEN) TO CB-BDATA(1:CUR-DLEN)
    END-IF
    MOVE CUR-NONCE TO CB-NONCE
    MOVE CUR-HASH TO CB-HASH
    MOVE HDR-DIFF TO CB-DIFFICULTY
    .

WRITE-HEADER.
    MOVE SPACES TO LEDGER-REC
    MOVE "CBCH|01|" TO LEDGER-REC(1:8)
    MOVE HDR-DIFF-X TO LEDGER-REC(9:2)
    MOVE "|" TO LEDGER-REC(11:1)
    WRITE LEDGER-REC
    IF LEDGER-FS NOT = "00"
        MOVE LEDGER-FS TO CB-FS
        MOVE CB-ERR-IO TO CB-STATUS
    END-IF
    .

WRITE-BLOCK.
    MOVE SPACES TO LEDGER-REC
    MOVE CUR-INDEX-X TO LEDGER-REC(1:8)
    MOVE "|" TO LEDGER-REC(9:1)
    MOVE CUR-TS TO LEDGER-REC(10:14)
    MOVE "|" TO LEDGER-REC(24:1)
    MOVE CUR-PREV TO LEDGER-REC(25:64)
    MOVE "|" TO LEDGER-REC(89:1)
    MOVE CUR-DLEN TO FILE-DLEN
    MOVE FILE-DLEN-X TO LEDGER-REC(90:3)
    MOVE "|" TO LEDGER-REC(93:1)
    IF CUR-DLEN > 0
        MOVE CUR-DATA(1:CUR-DLEN) TO LEDGER-REC(94:CUR-DLEN)
    END-IF
    MOVE "|" TO LEDGER-REC(222:1)
    MOVE CUR-NONCE-X TO LEDGER-REC(223:10)
    MOVE "|" TO LEDGER-REC(233:1)
    MOVE CUR-HASH TO LEDGER-REC(234:64)
    WRITE LEDGER-REC
    IF LEDGER-FS NOT = "00"
        MOVE LEDGER-FS TO CB-FS
        MOVE CB-ERR-IO TO CB-STATUS
    END-IF
    .

SET-NAME.
    MOVE SPACES TO LEDGER-NAME
    MOVE REQ-PATH(1:REQ-PLEN) TO LEDGER-NAME
    .

OPEN-IN.
    PERFORM SET-NAME
    OPEN INPUT LEDGER
    IF LEDGER-FS = "00"
        MOVE "Y" TO OPEN-FLAG
        MOVE "00" TO CB-FS
        MOVE CB-OK TO CB-STATUS
    ELSE
        MOVE LEDGER-FS TO CB-FS
        IF LEDGER-FS = "35"
            MOVE CB-ERR-NOT-FOUND TO CB-STATUS
        ELSE
            MOVE CB-ERR-IO TO CB-STATUS
        END-IF
    END-IF
    .

OPEN-OUT.
    PERFORM SET-NAME
    OPEN OUTPUT LEDGER
    PERFORM NOTE-OPEN
    .

OPEN-EXTEND.
    PERFORM SET-NAME
    OPEN EXTEND LEDGER
    PERFORM NOTE-OPEN
    .

NOTE-OPEN.
    IF LEDGER-FS = "00"
        MOVE "Y" TO OPEN-FLAG
        MOVE "00" TO CB-FS
        MOVE CB-OK TO CB-STATUS
    ELSE
        MOVE LEDGER-FS TO CB-FS
        IF LEDGER-FS = "35"
            MOVE CB-ERR-NOT-FOUND TO CB-STATUS
        ELSE
            MOVE CB-ERR-IO TO CB-STATUS
        END-IF
    END-IF
    .

CLOSE-LEDGER.
    IF FILE-OPEN
        CLOSE LEDGER
        MOVE "N" TO OPEN-FLAG
        IF LEDGER-FS NOT = "00" AND CB-STATUS = CB-OK
            MOVE LEDGER-FS TO CB-FS
            MOVE CB-ERR-IO TO CB-STATUS
        END-IF
    END-IF
    .

READ-ONE.
    READ LEDGER
        AT END
            MOVE "N" TO MORE-FLAG
        NOT AT END
            MOVE "Y" TO MORE-FLAG
    END-READ
    IF MORE-RECORDS AND LEDGER-FS NOT = "00"
        MOVE LEDGER-FS TO CB-FS
        MOVE CB-ERR-IO TO CB-STATUS
        MOVE "N" TO MORE-FLAG
    END-IF
    .

END PROGRAM CBCHAIN.
